  "body": "In https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#images-2:dom-imagebitmap-close\r\n > typedef \\(CanvasImageSource or\r\n>          Blob or\r\n>          ImageData\\) ImageBitmapSource;\r\n\r\n`ImageBitmapSource` refers to another IDL typedef (`CanvaImageSource`), but if IIUC WebIdl `typedef`s cannot refer to another (https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#dfn-typedef).\r\n(See https://github.com/WICG/shape-detection-api/issues/18 for where this came from).",
